[b]v1.1.0 — Splints[/b]
[list]
[*]Medics now apply splints on their own: when someone nearby needs one, the medic gets a "Splint Injuries" order, taking a splint kit from the nearest pack animal first if they have none. Thanks Meloo for the idea!
[/list]
Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Source: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-pack-medic]GitHub[/url]
